{"id":"t9o14r5vqsq14ccrmfn4cfqnz","title":"超市入口的新三样：烘焙、鲜花和果切","originalTitle":null,"summary":"超市入口从“价格入口”变为“情绪入口”，烘焙、鲜花和果切成为关键。烘焙市场规模预计2030年达2017亿元，鲜花和果切则通过“信任”、“减速”和“决策成本”吸引顾客，提升停留时间和客单价。入口位置的竞争不仅考验供应链，还需门店具备日清文化。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15325775.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T07:05:11.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T07:15:35.520Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T07:15:35.520Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告"],"score":20,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(零售圈)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}